  description: '2 WIND monsters

    During your Main Phase, you can: Immediately
    after this effect resolves, Normal Summon 1 WIND monster, also you cannot Special
    Summon monsters from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Synchro
    Monsters. You can banish 1 WIND Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck; reveal
    2 "Speedroid" monsters with different names from your Deck whose total Levels
    equal the Level of that Synchro Monster, your opponent randomly picks 1 for you
    to add to your hand, and you send the other to the GY. You can only use each
    effect of "Hi-Speedroid Rubber Band Shooter" once per turn.'
